---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout active="about" title="About — Finding Forward">

  <section class="ahead">
    <div class="wrap ahead__wrap">
      <div class="ahead__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Section — About</p>
        <h1 class="display ahead__h" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          Kevin <em>Roche</em>,<br/>
          LMHC · LPC.
        </h1>
        <p class="ahead__lead" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          Founder of Finding Forward, PLLC — a small online practice serving
          adults across Virginia and New York. Quiet by design.
        </p>
        <ul class="ahead__bits" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
          <li><span class="mono">License · NY</span> 009382</li>
          <li><span class="mono">License · VA</span> 0701010208</li>
          <li><span class="mono">Trained in</span> DBT · Self-Compassion · ACT</li>
          <li><span class="mono">Languages</span> English</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <figure class="ahead__photo" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
        <img src="/images/kevin.jpg" alt="Kevin Roche, LMHC LPC"/>
        <figcaption class="mono">Plate — the founder</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story">
    <div class="wrap story__wrap">
      <div class="story__col" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow no-bar">A short note from Kevin</p>
        <p class="display story__pull">
          <em>"</em>The clients I'm best for are the ones who suspect they're
          smarter than their patterns, and tired of being right about it.<em>"</em>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="story__col story__col--text">
        <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          I came to therapy the long way. Before this, I worked in roles that
          asked me to keep my own emotional weather invisible — the kind of work
          that teaches you to push through, then makes you wonder why you can't
          stop pushing.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          When I trained as a counselor, I was drawn to approaches that respect
          the client as the expert on their own life. DBT and self-compassion
          both work that way. They give you frameworks, not formulas, and assume
          you'll bring the wisdom about your particular situation.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
          The clients I tend to do best work with are thoughtful, often a bit
          self-critical, and ready to be slightly less alone with what they're
          carrying. If that sounds like the version of you reading this — let's
          have a conversation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="values">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>What you can expect</p>
      <h2 class="display values__h" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        Four small <em>promises</em>.
      </h2>
      <ol class="values__list">
        <li data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          <span class="display values__n">i.</span>
          <h3>I'll be on time.</h3>
          <p>And if I'm not, I'll tell you why, and the next session is on me. Small thing. Big trust.</p>
        </li>
        <li data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
          <span class="display values__n">ii.</span>
          <h3>I won't pretend.</h3>
          <p>If something's outside my scope, you'll hear that. I'd rather refer well than work shallow.</p>
        </li>
        <li data-reveal data-reveal-delay="4">
          <span class="display values__n">iii.</span>
          <h3>I'll be direct, kindly.</h3>
          <p>Vague reassurance helps no one. I'll say the thing — and we'll work with whatever you do with it.</p>
        </li>
        <li data-reveal data-reveal-delay="5">
          <span class="display values__n">iv.</span>
          <h3>You set the pace.</h3>
          <p>Some weeks we go deep. Some weeks we tend the garden. Both count.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .ahead {
    padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 120px) 0;
    background: var(--bone);
  }
  .ahead__wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 5vw, 80px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .ahead__copy { display: grid; gap: 22px; }
  .ahead__h {
    font-size: clamp(60px, 9vw, 152px);
    line-height: 0.93;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .ahead__h em { color: var(--clay); }
  .ahead__lead { font-size: 21px; max-width: 50ch; color: var(--ink-2); }

  .ahead__bits {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 18px 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 24px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .ahead__bits li { font-size: 16px; }
  .ahead__bits .mono { display: block; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 4px; }

  .ahead__photo {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(28,38,32,0.18);
  }
  .ahead__photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .ahead__photo figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 16px; left: 16px;
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .ahead__wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .story {
    padding: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px) 0;
    background: var(--bone-2);
  }
  .story__wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 5vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .story__col { display: grid; gap: 18px; }
  .story__pull {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 360;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 40;
  }
  .story__pull em { color: var(--clay); font-size: 1.4em; line-height: 0; vertical-align: -0.2em; font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 100; }
  .story__col--text p { font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 18px; max-width: 56ch; }
  .story__col--text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 880px) { .story__wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .values {
    padding: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px) 0;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .values .eyebrow { color: var(--sage); }
  .values .eyebrow::before { background: var(--sage); }
  .values__h {
    margin: 22px 0 clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px);
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 104px);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .values__h em { color: var(--sun); font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 100; }

  .values__list {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: rgba(250,245,234,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(250,245,234,0.12);
  }
  .values__list li {
    background: var(--ink);
    padding: 36px 28px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    align-content: start;
    transition: background 0.6s var(--ease);
  }
  .values__list li:hover { background: var(--ink-2); }
  .values__n {
    font-size: 40px;
    color: var(--clay);
    font-style: italic;
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 100;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .values__list h3 { font-size: 22px; color: var(--paper); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .values__list p { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(250,245,234,0.72); max-width: none; }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .values__list { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .values__list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
